  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Police Reform Programme Phase 2 (2012-2014) - Police Reform Programme Phase 2 (2012-2013)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Polisreformprogram fas 2 (2012-2014)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att bidra till omvandlingen av det serbiska inrikesministeriet till en civil Polismyndighet i niv&#xe5; med de b&#xe4;sta   europeiska standarder. Programmet inneh&#xe5;ller tre komponenter under    ett samlat ramverk f&#xf6;r administration och uppf&#xf6;ljning. Detta &#xe4;r ett   kompletterande beslut till beslut 2012-002112 f&#xf6;r ytterligare 7 562   474 SEK. Summan av beloppen i dessa tv&#xe5; beslut &#xe4;r 38 662 474 SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective is to contribute to the transformation of the Ministry of Interior of the Republic of Serbia into a civilian Police Service in line with the best of European standards. Contains three   components under a unique administrative and monitoring framework.    This is a supplementary decision to decision 2012-002112 for          additional 7 562 474 SEK. The sum of two budgets is 38 662 474 SEK.</narrative>
  </description>
